1
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:40,560
=Ren Yu=

2
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:43,000
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

3
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,960
=Episode 16=

4
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:57,760
Dongchen.

5
00:01:57,879 --> 00:01:58,840
Any word on Na?

6
00:01:59,120 --> 00:01:59,560
No.

7
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:01,359
Maybe there was something

8
00:02:01,439 --> 00:02:02,519
she wanted something there,

9
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:03,200
so she went back?

10
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:05,000
Maybe.

11
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,560
We fought about it before.

12
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:07,920
Right.

13
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:10,240
When did you say it went missing?

14
00:02:11,759 --> 00:02:12,719
A few days ago.

15
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:14,240
Probably hauled away.

16
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:15,879
Maybe Ma Na

17
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:17,080
went to a scrapyard nearby?

18
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,479
Right.

19
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:19,800
Could be.

20
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:21,599
I'll go now.

21
00:02:21,919 --> 00:02:22,879
Don't panic.

22
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,639
Mr. Ma.

23
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,319
You check north. We'll check south.

24
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:25,840
Split up.

25
00:02:26,199 --> 00:02:26,680
Okay.

26
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:27,919
Thanks.

27
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:28,759
Let's go.

28
00:02:28,879 --> 00:02:29,680
- Go.
- Bye, Mei.

29
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:38,160
(Shengliang Recycling Center)

30
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,080
Hi.

31
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,120
Seen someone this tall,

32
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:43,199
about my age?

33
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:43,879
No.

34
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:45,599
Hi.

35
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,319
Excuse me.

36
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,280
Have you seen

37
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,680
a girl around 17 or 18?

38
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,680
A student?

39
00:02:51,159 --> 00:02:52,240
No.

40
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,199
Hi.

41
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:57,360
Have you seen a girl

42
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,360
(Chaobei Vocational High School)
my age?

43
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,479
About this tall?

44
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:04,200
(Chaobei Vocational High School
Training Department)

45
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:06,960
Sir.

46
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,400
Seen a girl

47
00:03:08,479 --> 00:03:09,719
around 17 or 18?

48
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:12,000
Long hair, looks like a student.

49
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,800
No.

50
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,639
Stay back.

51
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,639
You're in my way.

52
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,479
Okay. Thanks.

53
00:03:28,759 --> 00:03:29,919
Doesn't smell good.

54
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:41,439
Mr. Zhou.

55
00:03:44,159 --> 00:03:45,319
Let's look around town.

56
00:04:05,039 --> 00:04:05,680
Mr. Zhou.

57
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:09,000
If Ma Na isn't at a scrapyard,

58
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:12,360
could she be at a bus or train station?

59
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:13,919
Open that case.

60
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,400
A phone's inside.

61
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,480
Call Ms. Wang.

62
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,160
Have her ask

63
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,360
is Jiang Ting home?

64
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:29,959
Ma Na!

65
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:36,519
Ma Na!

66
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,399
Ma Na!

67
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:38,959
Ma Na!

68
00:04:58,759 --> 00:04:59,240
Ma Na!

69
00:04:59,319 --> 00:04:59,759
Yang Le!

70
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:03,879
Ma Na!

71
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,240
Come here.

72
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:06,480
Ma Na.

73
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,720
Come here. It's dangerous.

74
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:10,360
We can talk this out.

75
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:12,120
It feels so good up here.

76
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:14,720
It feels

77
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,639
like I could fly.

78
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,519
Ma Na.

79
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,720
Call Ms. Wang.

80
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,240
Tell Ma Na's parents

81
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:27,759
we found her. Go!

82
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:28,279
Okay.

83
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:31,959
Ma Na.

84
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:33,800
It's windy and dangerous.

85
00:05:33,839 --> 00:05:34,759
Please come over here.

86
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:36,160
Listen to me. Come here.

87
00:05:38,759 --> 00:05:39,519
Mr. Zhou.

88
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:41,680
Don't you only care

89
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,920
about that contest?

90
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,920
I'm not kidding.

91
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:46,240
Kidding?

92
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,959
You think I'm playing?

93
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,000
You adults are all the same.

94
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,279
It's your fault,

95
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:52,639
but you blame me.

96
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:53,639
Trust me.

97
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,560
I won't.

98
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:56,560
I'm trying to help you.

99
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:57,879
Help me?

100
00:05:58,519 --> 00:06:00,000
Since when do you care?

101
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,800
Even if I jumped,

102
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:02,879
all you'd say is,

103
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,480
"Now we need a new Little Mermaid

104
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:05,279
read that trash."

105
00:06:05,319 --> 00:06:06,040
No, I wouldn't.

106
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:06,879
I promise.

107
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,120
Ma Na.

108
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:10,240
Anger's clouding your head.

109
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,639
It's taken over your heart.

110
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,519
Listen to me. Come here.

111
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:17,879
Enough, Mr. Zhou.

112
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,800
You think you sound so sophisticated?

113
00:06:25,639 --> 00:06:26,480
Some poet.

114
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,519
I don't get it.

115
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,000
You've got a wife.

116
00:06:32,199 --> 00:06:33,720
You work at the Cultural Center.

117
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,680
Just keep living off your wife.

118
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:41,680
Why write your stupid poems?

119
00:06:42,079 --> 00:06:43,439
Who are you trying to impress?

120
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,319
Don't come closer.

121
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,519
What are you doing?

122
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,079
The view is different

123
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,399
from up high.

124
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:37,560
Ma Na.

125
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,279
Know what happens

126
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:41,439
if you fall now?

127
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:47,519
Your center of gravity

128
00:07:48,079 --> 00:07:49,639
is in front of your sacrum.

129
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:52,639
In a free fall,

130
00:07:53,279 --> 00:07:55,360
you're likely to land headfirst.

131
00:07:59,439 --> 00:08:00,439
You'd crack your head.

132
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,000
Brains splattered everywhere.

133
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,399
And that's the lucky outcome.

134
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,639
If you're unlucky,

135
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:09,480
you land on your feet.

136
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,279
Your whole body

137
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,839
shattered.

138
00:08:13,959 --> 00:08:15,720
More precisely, you'd be paralyzed.

139
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,600
From then on,

140
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:20,360
you'd need help with everything.

141
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:22,160
Bathroom,

142
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,160
eating, getting dressed.

143
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,720
You'd be disabled,

144
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,360
trapped in a miserable life.

145
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,559
And that's still not the worst.

146
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:40,879
The worst

147
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,960
is landing on your backside.

148
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,159
Compression fractures everywhere.

149
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,240
Stop.

150
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:49,200
Your upper body would compress-

151
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:50,759
Shut up! I said stop!

152
00:09:05,879 --> 00:09:06,840
No, Na!

153
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,240
Na!

154
00:09:08,399 --> 00:09:09,279
Don't do this!

155
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:10,240
You hear me?

156
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:12,559
I need to talk to you.

157
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,720
Please listen to me.

158
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,360
Dongchen.

159
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,679
- Sir.
- Dongchen.

160
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:22,799
You okay?

161
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,519
You okay?

162
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,240
Na!

163
00:09:30,559 --> 00:09:31,159
Na!

164
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:32,720
Na!

165
00:09:33,759 --> 00:09:34,320
Stay back!

166
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:37,120
I was wrong this time.

167
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,639
Please forgive me.

168
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,440
I'll do anything.

169
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:42,279
Just don't hurt yourself.

170
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:43,600
Come down.

171
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,320
Stay back!

172
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,519
I will. I will.

173
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,320
Sending me abroad,

174
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:48,919
you threw my stuff away.

175
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:49,919
Na.

176
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:52,480
Hold onto the railing.

177
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:53,919
Listen to me.

178
00:09:54,919 --> 00:09:56,879
I know I rented out the old house

179
00:09:57,039 --> 00:09:58,120
without telling you.

180
00:09:58,879 --> 00:10:00,240
And I threw your things away.

181
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:00,799
Call cops.

182
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,600
Get behind her.

183
00:10:01,639 --> 00:10:03,679
Whatever I tossed, I'll get it back.

184
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:04,639
If I can't,

185
00:10:04,879 --> 00:10:06,240
I'll buy you another.

186
00:10:06,639 --> 00:10:07,159
Okay?

187
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,279
You threw away

188
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,960
the towel bunny Mom gave me.

189
00:10:11,279 --> 00:10:13,200
Can you get that back?

190
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,879
I really

191
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:20,840
didn't know.

192
00:10:21,799 --> 00:10:23,559
But I rented the house out

193
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:24,480
for your sake.

194
00:10:24,519 --> 00:10:25,360
For my own good?

195
00:10:25,799 --> 00:10:26,240
Yes.

196
00:10:28,159 --> 00:10:29,559
There it is again.

197
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:32,039
For my own good.

198
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,399
You always say that.

199
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,639
But you never care

200
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,200
what I think.

201
00:10:36,919 --> 00:10:37,960
Every time

202
00:10:38,519 --> 00:10:39,720
you don't want me around,

203
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,600
you dump me on someone else.

204
00:10:41,799 --> 00:10:43,360
Now you can't control me,

205
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,120
so you're sending me abroad.

206
00:10:45,559 --> 00:10:47,360
You just want me gone for good.

207
00:10:47,399 --> 00:10:49,720
You only care about yourself.

208
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:52,320
Ma Dongchen, listen.

209
00:10:52,679 --> 00:10:54,240
I'll never trust you again.

210
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,519
And I'm never going home.

211
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,399
I'm jumping.

212
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:58,879
Na, don't!

213
00:10:58,879 --> 00:10:59,879
You'll regret it forever!

214
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:00,679
Na!

215
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,759
Stay back!

216
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,399
Ma Na!

217
00:11:04,879 --> 00:11:05,440
Ma Na!

218
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:11,440
That was close.

219
00:11:14,639 --> 00:11:15,320
Come here.

220
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:28,760
Yeah.

221
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,600
Where does he live now?

222
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:33,399
Okay.

223
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:35,000
We'll verify it right away.

224
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,080
Then we'll call you.

225
00:11:36,759 --> 00:11:37,200
Thanks.

226
00:11:37,759 --> 00:11:38,120
Captain.

227
00:11:38,879 --> 00:11:40,120
How'd it go at Institute No. 2?

228
00:11:40,399 --> 00:11:41,039
Smooth.

229
00:11:41,399 --> 00:11:42,440
This case is top priority.

230
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:44,039
Put us first in line.

231
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:44,960
Nice.

232
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,440
Long trip, huh?

233
00:11:47,559 --> 00:11:48,720
Take a look at this list.

234
00:11:49,399 --> 00:11:50,919
Xiaobei Street Police Station called.

235
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,559
One name on their list,

236
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,080
Tang Leping,

237
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,039
moved out.

238
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:55,919
Rented it out.

239
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:58,360
He lives well outside the buffer zone.

240
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,279
So I think we can clear him.

241
00:12:00,799 --> 00:12:02,279
Then check the tenant too.

242
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,480
Tenant's Zhou Xijie.

243
00:12:03,559 --> 00:12:05,240
What we know so far,

244
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,879
(Zhou Xijie)
male, 35.

245
00:12:06,919 --> 00:12:08,360
Seems he works at Cultural Center.

246
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:09,720
I'll check the vehicle registry.

247
00:12:09,799 --> 00:12:10,759
If he fits,

248
00:12:11,159 --> 00:12:12,240
bring him in for blood.

249
00:12:37,519 --> 00:12:38,200
Easy.

250
00:12:42,559 --> 00:12:43,200
You okay?

251
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,519
I'm fine.

252
00:12:45,879 --> 00:12:47,399
I know Golden Bell Shield

253
00:12:48,639 --> 00:12:49,440
and Iron Shirt.

254
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,200
Don't worry.

255
00:12:52,919 --> 00:12:55,080
We'll follow the fishing line back.

256
00:12:55,399 --> 00:12:58,720
Lots of manholes have ladders.

257
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,200
We'll find one.

258
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,960
I'll pop the cover open.

259
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:04,480
Mm-hm.

260
00:13:06,559 --> 00:13:07,000
Let's go.

261
00:13:07,799 --> 00:13:08,279
Okay.

262
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:13,039
You okay, Mr. Gu?

263
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,039
You okay?

264
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:14,559
I'm fine.

265
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:15,600
You okay?

266
00:13:16,919 --> 00:13:17,519
Easy.

267
00:13:17,639 --> 00:13:18,120
I'm fine.

268
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,080
Ting!

269
00:13:26,799 --> 00:13:27,799
Ting!

270
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:28,919
Mom!

271
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,200
Mom, I'm here!

272
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,240
Jiang.

273
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:43,840
Jiang.

274
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:45,679
Mom.

275
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,120
Weren't you at work?

276
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,000
Work?

277
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,399
How could I?

278
00:13:52,919 --> 00:13:54,960
Your school called my office.

279
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,240
Jiang.

280
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:57,799
Don't be mad.

281
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,279
My fault.

282
00:13:59,679 --> 00:14:00,639
Of course it is!

283
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:01,840
Who else's?

284
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:02,120
Mom.

285
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,519
This isn't Mr. Gu's fault.

286
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:04,720
She's just a kid.

287
00:14:04,879 --> 00:14:06,639
You took her somewhere this dangerous?

288
00:14:06,759 --> 00:14:07,879
You're a grown man.

289
00:14:08,159 --> 00:14:09,039
I'm so sorry.

290
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,440
Go home.

291
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:14,720
Jiang Ting.

292
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,399
Give your mom her bag.

293
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:18,879
From now on,

294
00:14:19,519 --> 00:14:20,840
we're staying out of this.

295
00:14:25,559 --> 00:14:26,440
Go home.

296
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,120
(Info Desk)
ID?

297
00:14:43,679 --> 00:14:44,399
Young lady.

298
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,159
Without ID or registration,

299
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,240
you can't take the entrance exam.

300
00:14:49,919 --> 00:14:51,039
If you lost your documents,

301
00:14:52,039 --> 00:14:53,039
get replacements now.

302
00:14:55,679 --> 00:14:56,320
Su Lin.

303
00:14:56,799 --> 00:14:58,519
You said you're Su Lin?

304
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,080
Yes.

305
00:15:00,039 --> 00:15:01,960
But the records show

306
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:04,320
(Canceled)
Su Lin's registration was canceled.

307
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,480
Why was it canceled?

308
00:15:09,159 --> 00:15:11,960
Your family filed a death certificate.

309
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,720
(Resident Registration Form: Su Lin)

310
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:30,080
(Household Registration Division)

311
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:31,120
Miss.

312
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,080
Mom, are you still mad?

313
00:16:02,679 --> 00:16:04,240
Do you know

314
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:06,879
how dangerous it was?

315
00:16:07,759 --> 00:16:09,720
That's exactly why

316
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,519
I couldn't give up.

317
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,080
Mom, do you know

318
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:17,600
what those sewers are like?

319
00:16:18,919 --> 00:16:21,399
Beyond the flashlight beam,

320
00:16:22,679 --> 00:16:24,360
you can't see anything.

321
00:16:25,639 --> 00:16:26,519
Pitch black.

322
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:28,919
Dirty and stinking.

323
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,559
Rats everywhere.

324
00:16:33,759 --> 00:16:35,559
When Mr. Gu went up to the cover,

325
00:16:36,799 --> 00:16:38,320
I was terrified down there.

326
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,519
It was so dark,

327
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:43,759
with all these scary noises.

328
00:16:44,919 --> 00:16:46,240
I thought I'd die of fear.

329
00:16:47,919 --> 00:16:49,440
Mr. Gu kept calming me down,

330
00:16:50,639 --> 00:16:51,440
I heard nothing.

331
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,679
Nothing got through.

332
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:55,120
I just wanted out.

333
00:16:58,279 --> 00:17:00,360
I thought I'd never see you again.

334
00:17:02,879 --> 00:17:04,279
Then you came.

335
00:17:05,319 --> 00:17:07,200
When I saw you lift that cover,

336
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,920
I was so happy.

337
00:17:14,799 --> 00:17:15,319
Mom.

338
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:20,000
I'm so lucky to have you.

339
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:26,279
Then I think about Su Lin.

340
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:29,400
Her parents abandoned her.

341
00:17:30,839 --> 00:17:32,519
She's been down there so long.

342
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,200
She must be terrified.

343
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,480
All alone.

344
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,960
It's filthy down there.

345
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:42,119
Not even clean water.

346
00:17:42,359 --> 00:17:43,480
Let alone food.

347
00:17:45,039 --> 00:17:47,160
Could she still be alive?

348
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:59,119
Only Mr. Gu and I are looking now.

349
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:03,160
If I stop,

350
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:05,839
no one will look for Su Lin.

351
00:18:10,359 --> 00:18:11,799
Sneaking down there was wrong.

352
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:13,640
I know that.

353
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:16,039
But no matter what,

354
00:18:19,039 --> 00:18:20,920
I'm going to find Su Lin.

355
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:25,480
Or I'll regret it forever.

356
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:38,599
Ting.

357
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:42,319
If you trust me,

358
00:18:46,799 --> 00:18:48,279
leave it

359
00:18:51,799 --> 00:18:52,720
to me.

360
00:18:59,000 --> 00:18:59,680
Okay?

361
00:19:24,039 --> 00:19:24,680
Gu.

362
00:19:26,319 --> 00:19:27,319
What are you doing here?

363
00:19:28,039 --> 00:19:29,519
Dropped a file off at the province.

364
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:30,599
Came for a shower.

365
00:19:30,759 --> 00:19:31,400
Leaving soon.

366
00:19:37,079 --> 00:19:37,880
Where were you?

367
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:42,160
I went into the sewer.

368
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,000
Didn't I tell you not to?

369
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,119
Why won't you listen?

370
00:19:45,519 --> 00:19:47,119
Police are on it. Why go down?

371
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,240
I was worried.

372
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:49,960
So you act reckless?

373
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:51,519
Quit yelling at me.

374
00:19:52,359 --> 00:19:53,519
I need to tell you something.

375
00:19:59,359 --> 00:20:00,519
When I went down,

376
00:20:02,119 --> 00:20:03,599
