445
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:36,519
Stop. Stop.

446
00:24:37,960 --> 00:24:38,559
Jiang.

447
00:24:43,599 --> 00:24:44,599
What are you doing here?

448
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:47,759
Ting told me everything.

449
00:24:49,319 --> 00:24:50,680
I'm going to help her find Su Lin.

450
00:24:52,839 --> 00:24:53,279
Gu.

451
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,160
This is...

452
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:57,640
That coat

453
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:59,599
