470
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:36,319
Yes.

471
00:25:41,759 --> 00:25:42,960
You said

472
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:45,720
you went down through that manhole

473
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:47,480
by the towel factory housing complex.

474
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:48,160
Right.

475
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:53,759
After that, I don't remember

476
00:25:54,079 --> 00:25:56,400
if I turned left or right.

477
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,720
(Utility Map)
But I know

478
00:25:58,759 --> 00:25:59,720
I didn't go far.

479
00:26:00,559 --> 00:26:01,400
Then I reached

480
00:26:01,559 --> 00:26:03,319
a place like a reservoir.

481
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:05,759
That's where I found the coat.

482
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,119
A reservoir.

483
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:10,400
Near this line,

484
00:26:11,279 --> 00:26:12,759
(Utility Map)
just one reservoir.

485
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:17,359
Here.

486
00:26:18,319 --> 00:26:19,079
City Museum.

487
00:26:20,680 --> 00:26:21,240
Area B.

488
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:26,880
Li Hui.

489
00:26:26,960 --> 00:26:27,400
Yes.

490
00:26:27,559 --> 00:26:28,720
Request sewer-entry gear.

491
00:26:29,119 --> 00:26:29,599
Zhong Cheng.

492
00:26:29,839 --> 00:26:30,359
Yes.

493
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:31,519
Call the Planning Bureau.

494
00:26:31,839 --> 00:26:33,279
Have them assist the recovery.

495
00:26:33,920 --> 00:26:34,359
Tai Wei.

496
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:35,880
Get medical examiner.

497
00:26:36,559 --> 00:26:37,799
There may be another victim.

498
00:26:38,279 --> 00:26:38,680
Go.

499
00:26:39,079 --> 00:26:39,640
Yes.

500
00:26:42,079 --> 00:26:43,119
Thanks for your help, Gu.

501
00:26:43,519 --> 00:26:43,920
Sure.

502
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:44,599
Thanks.

503
00:26:47,599 --> 00:26:48,279
Gu.

504
00:26:49,759 --> 00:26:51,160
You're an important eyewitness.

505
00:26:52,119 --> 00:26:54,359
We need you to go back down

506
00:26:54,759 --> 00:26:57,519
