583
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,240
(Appearance Check)

584
00:31:14,240 --> 00:31:15,880
What do you do for work?

585
00:31:16,279 --> 00:31:17,319
Missing work for this?

586
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:18,599
Not at all.

587
00:31:19,359 --> 00:31:21,039
I work at the Cultural Center.

588
00:31:21,519 --> 00:31:22,400
It's been slow lately.

589
00:31:22,799 --> 00:31:23,480
I've got time.

590
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:27,920
No staff housing there?

591
00:31:28,480 --> 00:31:30,799
My wife and I live with her dad.

592
00:31:31,799 --> 00:31:33,039
I have

593
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:33,839
