594
00:31:34,279 --> 00:31:35,039
Clutters home.

595
00:31:35,559 --> 00:31:36,440
My wife hates it.

596
00:31:39,039 --> 00:31:40,039
So, a studio?

597
00:31:42,279 --> 00:31:42,960
Just storage.

598
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:47,240
Thanks for cooperating.

599
00:31:48,559 --> 00:31:49,079
Of course.

